---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Now" description="What Astrid is working on now, and what is open, as of a dated line.">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-heading">Now</h1>
  <p class="mt-4 text-ink-soft">This is what I'm working on right now, and whether I'm taking new work.</p>
  <p class="mt-4 text-ink-soft">As of [TBD: date]: [TBD: taking new work, or not, and for what].</p>

  <section class="mt-12" aria-labelledby="focus-heading">
    <h2 id="focus-heading" class="text-2xl font-semibold text-heading">Current focus</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-ink-soft">[TBD: current focus]</p>
  </section>

  <p class="mt-16 text-sm text-ink-subtle">Bread and roses.</p>
</Layout>
